  "description": "*\"To make Master Daeseung mine, I’ll do whatever it takes!\"*\n\nBeom Dae-seung, the young master of a noble family, is secretly in an intimate relationship with his close friend Kim Han-seo. Meanwhile, Seo Jae-ryong, who is deeply in love with Dae-seung, burns with jealousy toward Han-seo. His heart, sickened by unfulfilled love, drives him to make a vile and desperate choice…!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/demon_), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/demon_), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066306), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11762984)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/demon_), [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/demon_)  \nOthers: [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/demon), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/demon_)",
